{
  "name": "runebound-idle",
  "private": true,
  "version": "1.6.0",
  "description": "Runebound \u2014 an idle LitRPG. Skills, combat, gear, classes, a town to build, pets to raise, a codex that remembers, and a loop that does not. Beyond it: the Wastes, a descent, a bill, and something very large that was never switched off.",
